OL,3,GNEWSAThree men arrested after stabbing
OL,4,
OL,5,FThree people have been arrested after a
OL,6,Fman was taken to hospital with a stab
OL,7,Fwound.
OL,9,FLeicestershire Police said it was
OL,10,Fcalled to Aikman Avenue, in the New
OL,11,FParks area of Leicester, just after
OL,12,F14:45 BST on Friday following reports
OL,13,Fthat a man in his 20s had sustained a
OL,14,Fstab wound.
OL,16,FHe was taken to hospital with injuries,
OL,17,Fwhich the force said, were not believed
OL,18,Fto be life-threatening or
OL,19,Flife-changing.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
