OL,3,GNEWSAThree men arrested after stabbing
OL,4,
OL,5,FThree men, a 24-year-old and two aged
OL,6,F20, have been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fcausing grievous bodily harm with
OL,8,Fintent and remain in custody.
